 successfully complete our ongoing clinical trials and any future clinical trials we may initiate (including, in each case, combination clinical trials);

 successfully enroll the patients with specific cancers and prior treatment that are the focus of our clinical trials, such as patients with limited prior treatment lines in pancreatic and lung cancer for our ongoing monotherapy and combination trials for vopimetostat;

 initiate and successfully complete all safety and efficacy studies required to obtain U.S. and foreign regulatory approval for the sale of our product candidates and obtain approval of our products by regulatory authorities;

 make and maintain arrangements with third-party manufacturers for clinical supply and commercial manufacturing;

 obtain and maintain patent and/or trade secret protection or regulatory exclusivity for our product candidates;

 obtain and maintain patent and/or trade secret protection or regulatory exclusivity for our product candidates;

